Package: geosynth
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Coordinates for German Survey Data
Version: 0.8.0
Author: Stefan Jünger
Maintainer: Stefan Jünger <stefan.juenger@gesis.org>
Description: Provides tools to generate synthetic georeferenced data that 
    mimic the spatial structure of German survey datasets without exposing 
    confidential respondent coordinates. The package supports spatial linking 
    workflows by enabling pipeline development, testing, and methodological 
    prototyping outside of secure data access environments.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
